Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:25.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克莱蒂特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Cretites?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保罗·克莱蒂特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul Cretites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是拉蒂默\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Latimer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.30,0:01:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是来接你的 克莱蒂特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come to meet you, Mr. Cretites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边请 克莱蒂特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just come this way, Mr. Cretites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.30,0:01:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已经为你备好了一辆马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a carriage waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:29.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《希腊译员》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.00,0:02:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和福尔摩斯认识已久\N{\fnArial\fs30}During my long and intimate acquaintance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.29,0:02:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲密无间\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Sherlock Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.17,0:02:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但从未听他提起过他的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd never heard him refer to his relations, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.50,0:02:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也很少听他讲起自己早年的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hardly ever to his own early life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.32,0:02:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他这样沉默寡言 我有时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of this reticence, I sometimes found myself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.97,0:02:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会认为他是个孤僻的怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}regarding him as an isolated phenomenon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.05,0:02:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}缺少同情心\N{\fnArial\fs30}as deficient in human sympathy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.24,0:03:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但又有着过人的智慧\N{\fnArial\fs30}as he was pre-eminent in intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.26,0:03:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我开始认为他是个孤儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd come to believe that he was an orphan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.87,0:03:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有亲人在世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}with no relatives living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是有一天 让我倍感惊奇的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one day, to my very great surprise, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.39,0:03:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他居然和我谈起了他的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}he began to talk to me about his family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我独一无二的洞察力\N{\fnArial\fs30}My singular gift of observation introduction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.11,0:03:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能是遗传自我奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}may have come from my grandmother, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是法国艺术家巴内的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}who was a sister of Bernais, the French artist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.11,0:03:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}血液中的这种艺术成分\N{\fnArial\fs30}The art in the blood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很容易具有最奇特的遗传形式\N{\fnArial\fs30}is liable to take the strangest forms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.60,0:03:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如说 我哥哥 迈克罗夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}For example, my brother, Mycroft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.50,0:03:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.41,0:03:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直都不知道你有个哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know you had a brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.71,0:03:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且我可以向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can assure you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.73,0:03:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他身上具备了比我更惊人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he possesses a far greater faculty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.23,0:03:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}观察和推理能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}of observation and deduction than I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.67,0:03:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 我知道你是个谦虚的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, I know that you are a modest man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha-ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.95,0:03:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲爱的华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.51,0:03:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可不能同意你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot agree with those{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.28,0:03:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把谦虚看成是一种美德\N{\fnArial\fs30}that rank modesty among the virtues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.72,0:03:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于逻辑学家来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the legation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.56,0:03:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有东西该什么样就什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything should be seen exactly as it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.16,0:04:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个人低估自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to underestimate one's self{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.52,0:04:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同夸大自己的才能一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}is as much a departure from the truth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.98,0:04:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只会让他背离真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}as to exaggerate one's own ability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.75,0:04:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我所说的关于我哥哥的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I have just told you about my brother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.31,0:04:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是准确真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the exact and literal truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.82,0:04:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我当然相信你所说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, naturally, I don't doubt your word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.15,0:04:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果英格兰真的有另一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if there is another man in England{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.93,0:04:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有着如此超凡能力的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}with such singular powers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.38,0:04:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那为何警察 公众\N{\fnArial\fs30}how is it that neither the police nor the public{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.41,0:04:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至包括我 都没听说过他呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}have ever heard of him, let alone myself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.06,0:04:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在他自己的圈子里颇有名气\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's very well known in his own circles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么圈子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.27,0:04:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第欧根尼俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Diagones Club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.50,0:04:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是伦敦最奇怪的俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the oddest club in London, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.11,0:04:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我哥哥则是里面最怪的人之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my brother one of the oddest men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.43,0:04:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你肯定很想见见他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you wish to meet him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.33,0:04:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, of course I do, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管我只是想证实有这样一个人的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if it's just to prove that he exists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.07,0:05:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么下午你就可以得到答案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you shall, this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.72,0:05:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他遇到了一个很奇特的案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has come across the most singular problem, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.11,0:05:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且觉得我会有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}which he thinks might interest me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.72,0:05:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是为什么迈克罗夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why does Mycroft not use{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.39,0:05:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不靠他自己超群的推理能力来破案呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}his great powers for detective work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果侦探这门艺术只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the art of the detective began{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}靠坐在扶手椅上推理就行的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ended in reasoning from an arm chair, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.43,0:05:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我哥哥恐怕要成为历史上\N{\fnArial\fs30}my brother would be the greatest criminal agent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.31,0:05:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最伟大的侦探了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that ever lived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.39,0:05:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我赖以为生的侦探业务\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is to me a means of livelihood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.85,0:05:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对他来说仅是兴趣而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to him the merest hobby of a dilettante.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他没有此方面的抱负 也没有这个精力\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he has no ambition and no energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.61,0:05:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的职业是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is his profession, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.97,0:05:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有着惊人的数字天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has an extraordinary faculty for figures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他帮政府部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}He audits the books{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查账\N{\fnArial\fs30}for some of the government departments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.04,0:05:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么这个俱乐部的会员\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what are the qualifications{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.81,0:05:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是些什么样的人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the Diogenes Club?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.27,0:05:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些为人低调 有些愤世嫉俗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shyness and misanthropy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.94,0:05:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我哥哥是创始人之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}my brother is one of the founding members.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.23,0:05:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里接纳了镇上最孤僻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It contains the most unsociable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和最不爱交际的人 他们从不交谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}and clubful men in time who speak not a word{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.44,0:05:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使是他人的随意一瞥也会躲开\N{\fnArial\fs30}and shun even the merest glance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 我们进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let us enter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.03,0:05:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.86,0:05:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么都不要说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.70,0:06:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你有没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, have you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.05,0:07:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里可以说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can talk in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.30,0:07:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank goodness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看那两个人 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at those two men, Sherlock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.24,0:07:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有什么看法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you make of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中一个是弹子记分员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brilliant marker of the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.36,0:07:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.51,0:07:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那另一个呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you make of the other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.08,0:07:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该是一个老兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}An old soldier, I perceive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.74,0:07:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且最近心烦意乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And very recently distraught?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.41,0:07:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在印度服役\N{\fnArial\fs30}Served in India, I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.77,0:07:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个军士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a non-commissioned officer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜 是皇家炮兵队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relativity, I fancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个鳏夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a widower?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.73,0:07:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还带着一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.54,0:08:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不止一个 我亲爱的弟弟 是几个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children, my dear boy, children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.50,0:08:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha-ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.42,0:08:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迈克罗夫·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.09,0:08:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴见到你 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad to meet you, Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.28,0:08:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自从你为夏洛克作传\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear of Sherlock everywhere{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.37,0:08:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我到哪都能听到他的事迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}since you became his…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.35,0:08:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果谁想研究人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}For anyone who wishes to study mankind, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.41,0:08:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是最好的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is the spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可你们刚才讨论的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But surely you were taking things{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也太玄乎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little too far just now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这其实很好推测出 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not hard to say, Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.71,0:08:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的举止\N{\fnArial\fs30}that a man of that bearing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.38,0:08:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他威武的神情\N{\fnArial\fs30}and especially of authority{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.84,0:08:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}风吹日晒的皮肤 一望而知他是个军人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some big skin as a soldier{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且不是一个普通的军人\N{\fnArial\fs30}is more than a private, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.11,0:08:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且他刚从印度回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and is not long for India.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.09,0:08:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他刚退伍不久还表现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not long since left the service{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.97,0:08:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他仍穿着炮兵靴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}shown by his still wearing his ammunition boots, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.30,0:08:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们都这么叫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}as they're called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.77,0:08:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他走起路来不像骑兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has not the cavalry stride, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.89,0:08:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是他歪戴着帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he wore his hat on one side{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.25,0:08:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一点可以从他一侧眉毛上边\N{\fnArial\fs30}as is shown by the lighter skin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}较浅的皮肤看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}on one side of his brow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.83,0:08:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的体重不符合工程兵的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}His weight is against him being a sapper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以他应该在炮兵队\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is in the artillery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他悲伤的神情\N{\fnArial\fs30}There goes his complete mourning shows{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.82,0:08:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}表示他失去了某个至亲之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he has lost someone very dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.11,0:08:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从他自己出来买东西这点看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact that he's doing his own shopping{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.99,0:09:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他失去了他的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}looks as though it was his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.97,0:09:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看 他在给孩子们买东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been buying things for children, as you can see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.93,0:09:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一个拨浪鼓\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a wrap, which shows that one of them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.37,0:09:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说明有一个孩子很小\N{\fnArial\fs30}is very, very young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而他的腋下夹了一本图画书\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the fact that he has a picture book under his arm{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.21,0:09:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说明还有另外一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}shows there is another child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.65,0:09:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊哈 梅拉斯先生来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aha, Mr. Merlas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.49,0:09:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请进吧 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.18,0:09:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些都是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.16,0:09:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位是华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dr. Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.35,0:09:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的弟弟 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this is my younger brother, Sherlock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.73,0:09:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Mr. Sherlock Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我把梅拉斯先生叫来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've asked Mr. Merlas to step across.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.15,0:09:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就住在我楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lodges on the first floor above me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.34,0:09:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你会对他的故事感兴趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I thought you'd be interested in his story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.10,0:09:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是因为他 我才要你今天来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the reason why I asked you to call today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.95,0:09:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅拉斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Merlas, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.79,0:10:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他来找我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}he came to me, well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想还是让他自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think I shall ask Mr. Merlas to tell{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.61,0:10:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把他难忘的遭遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}his own very remarkable experiences{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.32,0:10:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}in his own fashion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.19,0:10:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.20,0:10:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些年来\N{\fnArial\fs30}For many years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.14,0:10:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在伦敦希腊翻译员中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been the chief{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.49,0:10:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首屈一指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greek interpreter in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.14,0:10:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察恐怕是不会相信我所说的事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not think that the police believe my story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就连我自己都很难相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my word, I do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.35,0:10:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他们以前从未听过这样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because they have never heard of it before, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.17,0:10:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们认为这样的事不可能发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}they think that such a thing cannot be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我知道 除非我弄清那个脸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know that I shall never be easy in my mind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.67,0:10:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贴着橡皮膏的可怜人的遭遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}until I know what has become of my poor man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.63,0:10:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则 我的心里是决不会轻松的\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a sticking plastered up on his face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.97,0:10:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}橡皮…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sticky…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅拉斯先生 你坐下说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Merlas, please sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.97,0:10:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 福尔摩斯先生 我宁愿站着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mr. Holmes, I prefer to stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.83,0:10:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:10:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都听着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am all attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.15,0:11:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一切都发生在两天前\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this happened only two days ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是周一晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}on Monday night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.47,0:11:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如之前说的 我是个希腊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Greek by instruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.45,0:11:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以翻译为生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And earn my living as an interpreter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.74,0:11:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在一些不寻常的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It often happens that I'm sent for at strange hours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.87,0:11:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}常常会有一些有困难的外国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}by foreigners who would get into difficulties{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.16,0:11:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是晚到的游客\N{\fnArial\fs30}or by travelers who would arrive late{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.94,0:11:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来找我帮他们翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wish my services.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.60,0:12:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅拉斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Merlas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.27,0:12:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.36,0:12:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很抱歉现在提出这个请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize for this intrusion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.23,0:12:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我现在急需\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I need the services{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.59,0:12:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}of an interpreter immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的名字叫拉蒂默\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Latimer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在就要去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Immediately?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.63,0:12:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实很紧急才来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't insist unless it were urgent, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有个希腊朋友因公事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a Greek friend of mine has just arrived{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.01,0:12:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刚来到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this country on business matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.89,0:12:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不幸的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, he speaks nothing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.66,0:12:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他只会讲希腊语\N{\fnArial\fs30}but his own tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.22,0:12:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也只会讲英语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I likewise so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅拉斯先生 拜托你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Merlas, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马车已经在外面等着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My carriage is waiting outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.61,0:12:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很远吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.80,0:12:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在肯辛顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only to Kensington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.13,0:13:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉挡住你的视线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to have to cut off your view, Mr. Merlas, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.15,0:13:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能让你看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the fact is, I have no intention that you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.24,0:13:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}should see the place to which we are driving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.16,0:13:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你再找到原路回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might possibly be inconvenient to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.66,0:13:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会有小麻烦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you were able to find your way back again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.79,0:13:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这实在是一种越规的行为 拉蒂默先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is very extraordinary conduct, Mr. Latimer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.44,0:13:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要知道 你的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be aware that what you're doing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.89,0:13:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是违法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is quite illegal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.19,0:13:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问 这有点失礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is somewhat of a liberty, no doubt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们会给你补偿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we'll make it up to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马车行使了将近两个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}For nearly two hours, we drove, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.62,0:13:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我丝毫不知道我在何处\N{\fnArial\fs30}without my having the least idea as to where I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.73,0:13:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you not notice any change{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}轮子下的声音有什么变化吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}of sound under the wheels?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我仔细听了 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I listened, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.73,0:14:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时候好像走在石板路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes we seemed to be on a paved causeway, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.17,0:14:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时候又好像是柏油路\N{\fnArial\fs30}sometimes on asphalt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.57,0:14:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但都不足以让我判断出到底身在何处\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there was nothing to tell me where I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有其他的声音了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no other sounds…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如说轮船的汽笛声 或是教堂的钟声？\N{\fnArial\fs30}a ship's siren or church bell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.39,0:14:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉 都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, nothing like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.47,0:14:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大约在什么时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}At what time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们到了目的地？\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you finally reach your destination?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.75,0:14:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}八点五十\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten minutes to 9:00, exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位就是梅拉斯先生吗 哈罗德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this Mr. Merlas, Harold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.69,0:15:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.63,0:15:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做得好 哈哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, Ha Ha Ha, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.55,0:15:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}well done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.53,0:15:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们没有恶意 梅拉斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No ill will, Mr. Merlas, I trust, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.43,0:15:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可没有你 我们办不成事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we could not get on without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.14,0:16:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你对我们诚实 你是不会后悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you deal fair with us, you'll not regret it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.73,0:16:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果你耍花招 那就自求多福吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you try any tricks, God help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.58,0:16:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们想要我做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.56,0:16:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是向拜访我们的希腊绅士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only to ask a few questions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.13,0:16:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a Greek gentleman who's visiting us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.63,0:16:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并告诉我们他的答复\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to let us have the answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.51,0:16:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你不得多嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you say no more than you are told, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要不然 小心你的小命\N{\fnArial\fs30}or it were better you had never been born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.02,0:16:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅拉斯先生 请继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Merlas, pray continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.13,0:16:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 然后这个人 恶毒的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then, this man, this evil man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把我带到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}showed me to a room which appeared to be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.82,0:16:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一间装修得很奇怪的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}very curiously furnished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.68,0:16:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}房间的唯一光线来自一盏\N{\fnArial\fs30}But again, the only light was afforded by a single lamp, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.31,0:16:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拧得很小的灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}half turned down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.42,0:17:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿石板给他 哈罗德\N{\fnArial\fs30}The slate, Harold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给他的手松绑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are his hands loose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.10,0:17:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以问问题了 梅拉斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will ask the questions, Mr. Merlas, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.84,0:17:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会把答案写下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he will write the answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.07,0:18:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask him, first of all, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.78,0:18:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是否准备好在文件上签字\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether he's prepared to sign the papers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.21,0:18:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝不签\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Never."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.20,0:18:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有商量的余地？\N{\fnArial\fs30}On no conditions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说 除非我亲眼看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}He writes, "only if I see her married{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她在我认识的希腊牧师作证下结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my presence by a Greek priest, whom I know."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.49,0:19:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha Ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.61,0:19:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你知道等着你的会是什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what awaits you, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说 他不在乎自己会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says, "I care nothing for myself."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.15,0:19:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so it went on, again and again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.22,0:19:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不得不再三问他是否\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to ask him whether he would give in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.09,0:19:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿意签那份文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sign the document.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.28,0:19:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但得到的都是同样的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again and again, I had the same indignant reply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.33,0:19:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很快 我就产生了一个想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But soon, a thought came to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.29,0:19:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在每次发问时加上自己要问的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took to adding on little sentences of my own{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.11,0:20:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}起初只是些无关紧要的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}to each question, innocent ones at first, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.28,0:20:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来试探我身边这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to test whether either of our companions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.67,0:20:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是否能听懂希腊语\N{\fnArial\fs30}knew anything of the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.28,0:20:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后我发现 他们毫无反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, as I found that they showed no sign, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.87,0:20:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我便大胆探问起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I played a more dangerous game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.60,0:20:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倔强对你没好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}This obstinacy is doing you no good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.29,0:20:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说 我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says, "I care not."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.69,0:20:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上 他还告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, he had also told me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.78,0:21:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在伦敦人生地疏\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was a stranger in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.59,0:21:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说他来这已经三个星期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He then told me he had been here three weeks, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.83,0:21:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且还不给饭吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}and was being forcibly starved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.46,0:21:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没饭吃？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starved?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.31,0:21:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你问出他名字了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you manage to find out his name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.61,0:21:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克莱蒂特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cretites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从雅典来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was from Athens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.30,0:21:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是很不幸 我只问到这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was all I could discover, unfortunately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.84,0:21:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是再多给五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another five minutes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.99,0:21:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就可以打探出\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I should have wormed out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.45,0:21:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这整件事的来龙去脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}the whole story under their very noses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再问他一遍 梅拉斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask him again, Mr. Merlas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.27,0:21:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在这时 门开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at that instant, the door opened, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.75,0:21:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个女人走了进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a woman stepped into the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.86,0:21:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说 绝不\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says, "never."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, ask him again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.22,0:21:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈罗德 我再也不能多呆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harold, I could not stay away any longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.82,0:22:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}索菲亚 索菲亚 索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia, Sophia, Sophia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.11,0:22:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 梅拉斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will do, Mr. Merlas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.54,0:22:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you perceive, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.18,0:22:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们没有拿你当外人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have taken you into our confidence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.31,0:22:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才请你参与了我们的私事\N{\fnArial\fs30}over some very private business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.13,0:22:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里是五磅金币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here are five sovereigns, which will, I hope, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.13,0:22:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想作为酬劳足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}be a sufficient fee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.80,0:22:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但请记住 如果你对任何人透露今晚的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But remember, if you speak to anyone about this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.39,0:22:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要对一个活人讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}one human soul, mind, well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.48,0:23:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的小命可就不保了\N{\fnArial\fs30}may God have mercy on your soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.13,0:23:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和去时一样 我上了一辆封闭的马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}As before, I was taken in a closed carriage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.57,0:23:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行使了大约两小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}for almost two hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.89,0:23:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我被他们丢下车 我才发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}There I was abandoned, as I was later to discover, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.06,0:23:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是旺兹沃思荒地附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}near Wentsworth Common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.61,0:24:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了刚才对你讲的事情之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not know where I had been, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.80,0:24:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我既不知所到何地\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor whom I had spoken with nor anything, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.82,0:24:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不知和我谈话的是何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}saving what I have told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.96,0:24:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我知道有人在进行肮脏的勾当\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know there is foul play going on, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.88,0:24:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想帮助那个可怜的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I want to help that unhappy man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.11,0:24:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}苍天作证 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}before God, I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.98,0:25:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迈克罗夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.11,0:25:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迈克罗夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.94,0:25:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.50,0:25:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}采取什么措施了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What steps have you taken so far?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.73,0:25:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是登在日报上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this was in all the daily papers:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.43,0:25:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「如果有任何人能提供关于\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Anyone having information as to the whereabouts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.72,0:25:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「某不通英语的希腊绅士\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a Greek gentleman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.87,0:25:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保罗·克莱蒂特的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}named Paul Cretites, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.64,0:25:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「当予重酬\N{\fnArial\fs30}who cannot speak English, will be rewarded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.56,0:25:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「另外 如果您能提供关于\N{\fnArial\fs30}As ever a reward will be paid to anyone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.33,0:25:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「一位名叫索菲亚的希腊女士的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}having information about a Greek lady, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.83,0:25:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「也将获得报酬」\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose first name is Sophia, "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.81,0:25:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是还没有任何回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no answer as yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.00,0:25:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希腊公使馆那边有消息么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the Greek Legation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.15,0:25:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我问过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have tried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.98,0:25:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们对此一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.92,0:25:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就快发电报给雅典警察局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The head of the Athens police, then!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.72,0:25:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夏洛克是我们家精力最旺盛的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock has all the energy in the family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.09,0:25:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要用尽办法把案子查清\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you take up a case, by all means, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.28,0:25:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果有好消息就告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}let me know if you do any good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.99,0:25:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.35,0:25:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅拉斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Merlas, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.60,0:26:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be extremely careful, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.96,0:26:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一定会加倍小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I were you, but of course, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.57,0:26:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他们一看到这些广告\N{\fnArial\fs30}through these advertisements, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.65,0:26:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就会知道是你出卖了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll know that you've betrayed them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.81,0:26:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.94,0:26:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走路当心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.61,0:27:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我看来 那个希腊姑娘很明显是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems to me obvious that this Greek girl has been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.22,0:27:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被那个叫哈罗德·拉蒂默的年轻英国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}carried off by the young Englishman, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.99,0:27:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给拐骗走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harold Latimer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.93,0:27:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从哪拐骗来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carried off from where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.01,0:27:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能是雅典\N{\fnArial\fs30}Athens, perhaps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.95,0:27:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不不不 这个哈罗德·拉蒂默\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no… this Harold Latimer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.31,0:27:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会讲希腊语\N{\fnArial\fs30}cannot speak a word in Greek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.87,0:27:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个女孩英语讲得很流利\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl speaks English fairly well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.64,0:27:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么说来 她应该在英格兰待过一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}inference that she has been in England some little time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.87,0:27:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而他没去过希腊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he has not been in Greece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.97,0:27:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 杰克森小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you Miss Jackson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.26,0:27:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 那让我们假设那个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, let's presume that the girl{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.66,0:27:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来英格兰游玩 而那个哈罗德\N{\fnArial\fs30}was visiting in England and that this Harold{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.37,0:27:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}劝她和他私奔\N{\fnArial\fs30}persuaded her to fly with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.93,0:27:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个可能性更大点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is more probable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.97,0:27:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后她的哥哥 应该是她的亲戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the brother, that must be the relationship, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.00,0:27:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从希腊前来干涉\N{\fnArial\fs30}comes over from Greece in order to intervene, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.71,0:27:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们看到了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}they see him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.65,0:27:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用武力强迫他签下一些文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}use violence to force him to sign some documents, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.71,0:27:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把女孩的财产转移到他们的名下\N{\fnArial\fs30}making over the girl's fortune to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.59,0:27:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可能是财产的受托人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's probably the trustee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.94,0:27:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后 就像我们听到的 他拒绝签字\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, as we have heard, he refuses to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.01,0:27:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至今仍不妥协\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.16,0:27:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些人不会善罢甘休\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these men will not stop now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.55,0:28:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不论发生什么 我们都必须找到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happens, Watson, we must find them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.64,0:28:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么找？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.73,0:28:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们的推测没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if our conjecture is correct, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.02,0:28:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这姑娘的名字应该是索菲亚·克莱蒂特\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the girl's name is… or was… Sophia Cretites, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.62,0:28:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要找到她应该不难\N{\fnArial\fs30}we should have no difficulty in tracing her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.75,0:28:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是我们的主要希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must be our main hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.25,0:28:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他哥哥在城里没人认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brother, of course, is a complete stranger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.90,0:28:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进来 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, Sherlock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.36,0:28:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进来 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.61,0:28:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没想到我有如此精力 是不是 夏洛克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't expect such energy from me, do you, Sherlock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.22,0:28:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.36,0:28:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是怎么来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, How did you get here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.45,0:28:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们在电报局的时候我赶过了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I passed you while you were in the telegraph office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.20,0:28:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我登的广告有回复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had an answer to my advertisement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.70,0:28:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在你们离开不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}It came within a few minutes of your leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.41,0:28:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么消息？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what effect?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.29,0:29:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是用宽尖钢笔写在淡黄色纸上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is written with a Jay pen on royal cream paper{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.77,0:29:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}写信人是个身体孱弱的中年男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}by a middle-aged man with a weak constitution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.15,0:29:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「阁下 鉴于您今天登报所提及的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sir, in answer to your advertisement of today's date, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.38,0:29:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我很荣幸告知您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg to inform you that I know the young lady{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.41,0:29:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我对她非常了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}in question very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.28,0:29:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「欲知详情 请到鄙处一坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you should care to call upon me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.47,0:29:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「当能告知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could give you some particulars{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.04,0:29:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「她过去痛苦的经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}as to her painful history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.54,0:29:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「她现正在贝克纳姆之默特尔兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's at present at Memerkle's Beckinum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.56,0:29:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「此致敬礼 杰·达文波特」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours faithfully, Jay Davenport."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.00,0:29:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是从下布里克斯顿寄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He writes from Lower Brigestone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.19,0:29:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们现在何不到那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you not think we should drive there now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.59,0:29:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去把详情了解一番？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and learn these particulars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.84,0:29:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲爱的迈克罗夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Mycroft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.92,0:29:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她哥哥的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her brother's life is more important{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.59,0:29:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比妹妹的故事更加重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}than the sister's story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.89,0:29:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我们得先去苏格兰场\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we should call at Scotland Yard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.24,0:29:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找格雷森警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Inspector Gregson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.70,0:29:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后直接去贝克纳姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then go straight out to Beckinum, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.41,0:29:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要知道 那人的性命正危在旦夕\N{\fnArial\fs30}where we know that a man is being done to death, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.96,0:29:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要争分夺秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every hour maybe vital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.56,0:29:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要不要顺便去接梅拉斯先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better pick up Mr. Merlas on the way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.17,0:29:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接他干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.25,0:29:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我们需要一个希腊翻译啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we may need a Greek interpreter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.69,0:30:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说得好 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.72,0:30:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我们所了解到的线索 我得说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should say from what we have heard, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.12,0:30:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们遇到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we are dealing with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.78,0:30:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个很危险的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}a particularly dangerous guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.44,0:30:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅拉斯先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Merlas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.01,0:30:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.84,0:30:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}楼下有位先生要见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a gentleman downstairs to see you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.34,0:30:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪位先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What gentleman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.80,0:30:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说是今天和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he said he met you today{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.16,0:30:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在第欧根尼俱乐部见面的先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the Diogenes Club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.93,0:30:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes! Thank you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.11,0:30:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚上好啊 梅拉斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, Mr. Merlas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.64,0:31:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚上好 斯特德太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, Mrs. Sterd, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.78,0:31:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麻烦你告知梅拉斯先生 我们有要事找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you tell Mr. Merlas I need to see him urgently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.70,0:31:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 梅拉斯先生现在不在这 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Mr. Merlas is not here, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.79,0:31:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刚刚有位绅士找他一起离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gentleman just called for him, and he left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.39,0:31:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道他们去哪了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell me where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.44,0:31:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这我可不知道 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't know, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.79,0:32:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.83,0:32:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他和那位绅士上了辆马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}he drove off with a gentleman in a carriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.44,0:32:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那位绅士有说他的名字吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the gentleman give a name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.69,0:32:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.94,0:32:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是不是一个年轻 英俊的黑大个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't a tall, handsome, dark, young man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.34,0:32:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 不是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.49,0:32:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他个子不高 戴着眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a little gentleman, with glasses, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.41,0:32:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}脸很瘦 但是很有礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}thin in the face, but very pleasant in his ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.47,0:32:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说话的时候一直都在笑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was laughing all the time he was talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.18,0:32:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.35,0:32:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去苏格兰场 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scotland Yard, and hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.78,0:32:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有许可证可行不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}It cannot be done without a warrant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.87,0:32:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先别管许可证了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not disputing that, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.62,0:32:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算他们是罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if they are criminals, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.60,0:32:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那也是私人住宅 法律规定…\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is a private house and the law demands…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.21,0:32:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法律规定我们要快点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The law demands that we act quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.00,0:32:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就不能找个地方法官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you not find a Magistrate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.25,0:32:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我们签张许可证吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to sign this warrant for us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.92,0:32:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就现在？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A this hour?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.76,0:33:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this very minute{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.26,0:33:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要不然绑架案就要变成谋杀案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}our kidnapping could become murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.01,0:33:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我试试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can but try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.52,0:33:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.74,0:33:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉他 我已经失去理智了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him, I have ceased being reasonable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.57,0:33:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他还不签字\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he does not sign the papers now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.64,0:33:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.66,0:33:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉他 我已经没有耐性了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him I have no more patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.74,0:33:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.60,0:34:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.54,0:34:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.15,0:34:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.23,0:34:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求求你了 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Inspector…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.21,0:34:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非得要许可证吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}will you not come without a warrant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.40,0:34:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry, gentlemen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.38,0:34:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已经浪费了快一个小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have wasted nearly an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.99,0:34:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法律可催不得 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The law cannot be hurried, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.99,0:34:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅拉斯先生的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The life of Mr. Merlas{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.97,0:34:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在就掌握在你手中了 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}is in your hands, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.56,0:34:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉他 呃 告诉他如果我杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him… hmm… tell him if I kill him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.09,0:34:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他妹妹对我也没任何用处了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no use anymore…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.43,0:34:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以她也得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}for his sister, and she will die, also.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.18,0:34:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你不能… 告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you wouldn't… TELL HIM!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.77,0:35:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 先生们 签好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it is, gentlemen… it's signed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.96,0:35:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在快找个人把我们载到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get someone to drive us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.00,0:35:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伦敦桥站去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}to London Bridge Station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.35,0:35:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但愿还不算太晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray we're not too late!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.47,0:36:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一辆满载着行李四轮马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}A carriage heavily loaded with luggage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.24,0:36:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}半小时前刚开走\N{\fnArial\fs30}has passed that within the last half-hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.64,0:36:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这里等我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for us here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.12,0:36:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贼窝已经空了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nest is empty and the birds are flown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.30,0:37:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's sulfur!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.90,0:37:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迈克罗夫 拿着灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft, get the lamp!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.38,0:37:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来 帮我把他们搬出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, help me with the bodies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.43,0:37:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.63,0:37:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.38,0:37:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个可怜人肯定就是保罗·克莱蒂特\N{\fnArial\fs30}The poor wretch must be Paul Cretites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.68,0:37:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕不再是了 他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more, I'm afraid. His life is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.70,0:37:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们应该早点来的 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should have been here sooner, Inspector!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.24,0:37:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他已经死了大约4个小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have been dead about four hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.33,0:37:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些气体是硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gas made of sulfur, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.83,0:38:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没说错吧 华生医生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}am I not right, Dr. Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.23,0:38:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是被打死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beaten to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.67,0:38:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是梅拉斯先生还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Mr. Merlas still lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.96,0:38:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 赶快把他搬出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick! Let's get him out of here as fast as possible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.57,0:38:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警长 快去拿白兰地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inspector, brandy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.97,0:38:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放松 梅拉斯先生 你现在安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, Mr. Merlas, you're in safe hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.57,0:38:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把他身上的绳索解开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the ropes off him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.59,0:38:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我粗略看了一下那位女士的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}From a brief look at her room, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.84,0:38:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她已经匆匆忙忙地离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the lady left in haste, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.20,0:38:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但没有打斗痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}but without a struggle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.01,0:38:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个叫拉蒂默的男人对她肯定还有控制力\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man Latimer must still have some power over her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.21,0:38:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}One wonders, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.23,0:38:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她为了哈罗德·拉蒂默\N{\fnArial\fs30}with how much remorse she abandoned her brother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.94,0:38:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而抛弃她哥哥会不会懊悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Harold Latimer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.50,0:39:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还是对妇女抱有偏见？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still retain your low opinion of women?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.93,0:39:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在此事上 我可能无法公平看待\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this instance, I cannot maybe justify.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.93,0:39:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 他们好像查询过列车时刻表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, they appear to have consulted a Bradshaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.54,0:39:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this page.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.73,0:39:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是联运火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boat train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.13,0:39:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凶手走不远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The murderers won't get far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.01,0:39:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以在英格兰每个港口都派人守着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have man at every port in England, if need be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.30,0:39:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这辆车在伦敦和多佛之间会停一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boat train makes one stop between London and Dover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.05,0:39:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}停在霍恩山 23分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}At Hurn Hill in 23 minutes, precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.93,0:39:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好 警长 你就陪着这位第一目击者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. Stay with your chief witness, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.75,0:39:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可能需要给他录份笔录\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may need a statement from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.36,0:39:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且他需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he will need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.02,0:39:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他喝点白兰地和阿摩尼亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little brandy, and ammonia at frequent intervals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.45,0:40:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迈克罗夫 我可没法跑那么快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft, I'm not built for running so hard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.52,0:41:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请出示你的车票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tickets, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.44,0:41:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就不能把票给准备好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you kindly have your tickets ready, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.86,0:41:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我叫夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.63,0:41:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Sherlock Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.82,0:41:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看过你的破案故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've read about your cases, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.70,0:41:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据验票情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we the last passengers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.95,0:41:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是最后上车的乘客了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}from whom you have collected tickets?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.62,0:41:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 先生 我一直在火车上工作 从另一头开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed, sir. I always work at the engine, start there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.44,0:41:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一路验票到这\N{\fnArial\fs30}and work my way back to the garden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.90,0:41:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你就可以帮我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you can help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.95,0:41:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有三个乘客 两男一女\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are three passengers, two men and a woman, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.18,0:41:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一起坐车\N{\fnArial\fs30}traveling together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.23,0:41:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们也许表现得不像同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}They may not appear to be companions, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.90,0:41:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但一定呆在同一间车厢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they will be in a compartment alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.09,0:41:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}年纪大点的带着副厚厚的眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The elder man wears thick-lensed glasses, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.70,0:41:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}年轻的那个长的很英俊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the younger one is quite handsome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.47,0:41:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们带了很多行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will have a great deal of luggage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.62,0:41:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上面有前往欧洲的标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}marked for the Continent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.67,0:41:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有见过他们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen such a party?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.13,0:41:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有见过 我可以帮你 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, indeed, I can help you, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.05,0:41:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never doubted it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.03,0:41:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}火车上有两组人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are two parties{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.29,0:41:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}符合你的描述 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}who fit that description, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.06,0:41:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两组？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.52,0:41:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请出示你的车票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ticket, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.47,0:41:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在B4号房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Compartment B4…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.56,0:41:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}B4 还有D8\N{\fnArial\fs30}B4. and D8.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.02,0:41:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 乘务员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.74,0:42:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎样知道哪两个是凶手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know which two are the murderers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.03,0:42:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再简单不过了 不 别吵醒他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It couldn't be simpler. No, don't wake him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.04,0:42:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们两个去就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's danger enough for the two of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.99,0:42:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一个是来自代佛德的左撇子出版商\N{\fnArial\fs30}A left-handed printer from Detford.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.44,0:42:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的哥哥喝多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His older brother drinks too much{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.74,0:42:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且还有肝病\N{\fnArial\fs30}and is pained by his liver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.87,0:42:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是我们要找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't harm mine then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.43,0:42:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.19,0:42:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那这个女孩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.54,0:42:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不认识这两个男的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knows neither of them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.69,0:42:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是个布拉福德的机械师\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's a machinist from Bradford{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.15,0:42:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是去度假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's going on a Holiday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.99,0:43:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺便寻找爱情\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find romance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.01,0:43:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些都说明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means, undoubtedly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.95,0:43:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凶手不在B4\N{\fnArial\fs30}the murderers aren't in Compartment B4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.29,0:43:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 克莱蒂特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Miss Cretites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.01,0:43:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐着不要动 拉蒂默先生 进来吧 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do sit still, Mr. Latimer. Do come in, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.32,0:44:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你究竟是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.62,0:44:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一个人不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The third member of the party is absent, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.50,0:44:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我肯定他会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm sure he will return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.42,0:44:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克莱蒂特小姐 我能问你个问题吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Cretites, may I ask{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.09,0:44:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是这个男人绑架你还是你自愿跟他走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you are this man's prisoner or companion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.91,0:44:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么都不要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.89,0:44:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们没有权利问你任何问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have no right to ask you anything at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.03,0:44:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他们是警察的话 早就自报家门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they were the police, they would have said so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.32,0:44:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么是警察呢 拉蒂默先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the police, Mr. Latimer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.41,0:45:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道你知道他们会来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you expecting to meet them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.33,0:45:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 我不知道你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know who you are, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.94,0:45:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不知道你是怎么知道我的名字的\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor do I know how you know my name, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.87,0:45:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我正和我的未婚妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm traveling with my fiancee{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.64,0:45:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前往欧洲 准备在那结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the Continent to get married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.04,0:45:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 麻烦你们离开好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, would you please leave us alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.50,0:45:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要不然 我就要叫警卫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, I shall be obliged to call a guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.22,0:45:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你就叫吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.05,0:45:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我肯定华生乐意代为效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure Dr. Watson would do it for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.42,0:45:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 想必你是知道我是谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I see you know who I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.07,0:45:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 我能否\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then may I be permitted to ask{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.64,0:45:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再问你未婚妻一次呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}your fiancee the question again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.23,0:45:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true what he said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.11,0:45:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是要去结婚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going to be married?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.30,0:45:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.98,0:45:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雅典\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Athens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.54,0:45:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕去不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.00,0:45:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁敢阻挡我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who is going to stop us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.57,0:45:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果警察不阻止 我也会\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not the police, then I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.13,0:45:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克莱蒂特小姐 你真的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Cretites, do you seriously want me to believe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.37,0:45:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自愿离开英格兰的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you are leaving England willingly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.08,0:45:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.75,0:45:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了嫁给这个谋杀了你哥哥的男人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To marry the man who has just murdered your brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.36,0:45:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.41,0:45:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 谋杀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Murdered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.06,0:46:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是真的 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't true, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.73,0:46:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他身体康复后会尽快来希腊和我们会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to meet us in Greece as soon as he's well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.03,0:46:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是这样对我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you said to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.59,0:46:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会的 索菲亚 他会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he will Sophia, he will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.68,0:46:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你哥哥死了 克莱蒂特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother is dead, Miss Cretites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.40,0:46:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别听他胡说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.17,0:46:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在贝克纳姆的房子里发现了他的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found his body myself in the house in Beckinum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.54,0:46:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他被杀死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had been murdered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.21,0:46:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被折磨致死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}tortured to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.57,0:46:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 这不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.07,0:46:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈罗德 告诉我 到底怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harold, tell me what's happened!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.89,0:46:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于你 拉蒂默先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for you, Mr. Latimer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.77,0:46:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅拉斯先生还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Merlas is alive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.75,0:46:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为证人他将亲眼看着你被绞死\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a witness to see you hanged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.14,0:46:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救我 索菲亚 救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, Sophia, help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.69,0:47:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救我 救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.16,0:47:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那很不错 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}went very well, very well indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.30,0:47:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有朋友死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have friends dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.17,0:47:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想不用我多说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but I need not elaborate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.51,0:47:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我看来 你是个阅历丰富的人 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I see you are a man of the world, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.00,0:47:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the contrary…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.46,0:47:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从未离开过英格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never left England in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.59,0:47:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.42,0:48:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.30,0:48:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么先生 如果你一定要选一个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then sir, if you must choose one country, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.75,0:48:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就选希腊\N{\fnArial\fs30}it must be Greece…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.42,0:48:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}众神之岛 还有橄榄枝和阴谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}the land of Gods, olives and intrigue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.10,0:48:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是我的目的地 希腊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my destination, Greece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.86,0:48:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你会说希腊语吗 先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you speak Greek, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.05,0:48:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会 但我们能找个好翻译啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but one can always find a good interpreter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.15,0:48:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.97,0:48:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是美味佳肴\N{\fnArial\fs30}An excellent meal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.41,0:48:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 再见了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, good bye, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.77,0:48:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能够遇见你是我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a pleasure meeting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.38,0:48:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.32,0:48:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和你聊得很愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an interesting conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.12,0:48:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do apologize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.71,0:48:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时候我会忘了自己有多重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes, I forget my size.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.74,0:48:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.54,0:49:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保罗的事是真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true about Paul?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.78,0:49:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.21,0:49:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恨哈罗德·拉蒂默\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hated Harold Latimer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.07,0:49:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恨他 同时我也爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hated him, and I loved him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.98,0:49:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我愿意做他要我做的任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have done anything he said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.11,0:49:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我愿意和他去任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have gone anywhere with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.49,0:49:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使他杀了你哥哥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though he murdered your brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.56,0:49:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, even then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.02,0:49:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯纳先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Cana, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.21,0:49:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们正等着你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were expecting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.73,0:50:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你的左轮手枪吧 先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe this is your revolver, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.59,0:50:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲爱的哥哥…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, brother of mine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.53,0:50:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们似乎走上了犯罪的道路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we seem to be heading down the path of crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.04,0:50:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我唯一想走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only path I intend to take{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.71,0:50:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是去往第欧根尼俱乐部大门的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the door to the Diogenes Club, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.63,0:50:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们可别跟来\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I will close behind me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.13,0:50:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她会怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will become of her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.59,0:50:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问几个问题就没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After questioning, nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.52,0:50:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她虽冷血 无情\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not a crime to her cold heart, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.40,0:51:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但还构不上犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not a single shred of compassion.{\r}
